  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n67.96 + 5.12 − 0.89 ÷ 31.88\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/eafd54de9d9fc295c072d1fa0b8367ee3ed24189b7ad133a51c29266134693c4.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n67.96 + 5.12 − 0.89 ÷ 31.88\n\n⇒ 68 + 5 - 1 ÷ 32\n\n⇒ 68 + 5 - (1/32)\n\n⇒ 73 - (1/32)\n\n⇒ 73 - 0.3125\n\n⇒ 72.96875 ≈ 73\n\n**∴ Required answer is 73.**",
